# Allowlist: send the builder only what `go build` needs. Everything else
# (docs, CI config, local databases, .env, build output, editor files) stays
# out of the context, so it can neither leak into the image nor invalidate
# the COPY . . layer.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!web

# Local leftovers inside the allowed directories.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.swp
